WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
The 1940s.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.687
Post-War Reconstruction.

00:00:04.687 --> 00:00:07.750
Canada emerges from World War II.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:13.712
The Veterans Charter promises housing, education, and support for returning soldiers.

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:18.762
The foundation is laid for the social contract that the government will later break.
